    "sections": {
        "description": "Pari Cosmetics, Beauty, and Fashion WooCommerce WordPress FSE Block Theme is a modern and versatile Full Site Editing theme designed for cosmetics, beauty, fashion, and apparel brands. Ideal for boutiques, beauty stores, designers, and fashion bloggers, this theme offers a responsive and stylish design that highlights your products and stories beautifully. With seamless WooCommerce integration, customizable block patterns, and advanced typography, Pari makes it easy to create a professional online store or portfolio without coding. Optimized for SEO and fast performance, this theme ensures a smooth user experience across mobile, tablet, and desktop devices while supporting popular plugins for enhanced functionality. Documentation: [https://docs.omnipressteam.com/]"
